BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td (Bootprint) Tj T* () Tj T* (EXECUTIVE SUMMARY: BOOTPRINT) Tj T* () Tj T* (Problem) Tj T* () Tj T* (Online shoes are returned a lot. This is a big problem for the shoe brands because when) Tj T* (customers return shoes the brand loses money and has to pay shipping two times. Many people buy) Tj T* (shoes online and the shoes do not fit them, so they send them back. We believe the return rate) Tj T* (for shoes is very high, higher than other products, and it is going up as more people buy) Tj T* (online. Small footwear brands are especially hurt by this problem because they are small and) Tj T* (can not afford the returns like big brands can. The customers is also unhappy when shoes do not) Tj T* (fit. Sizing is a problem that nobody has solved yet and it is a huge pain point for the whole) Tj T* (ecommerce footwear industry.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Solution) Tj T* () Tj T* (Bootprint is a innovative AI sizing solution that solves the sizing problem. The customer uses) Tj T* (their phone to scan their foot and then our proprietary data driven recommendation engine tells) Tj T* (them what size to buy from the brand. Because the engine is using data, the recommendation is) Tj T* (very accurate and gets better over time as it learns. We also have a physical product which is) Tj T* (the Bootprint mat. The customer puts their foot on the mat when they scan, and the mat helps) Tj T* (the phone to see the foot size better. Brands will put Bootprint on their website and the) Tj T* (customers will scan and then buy the right size and not return. This is a seamless end to end) Tj T* (solution that reduces returns, increases customer satisfaction, and leverages machine learning) Tj T* (and computer vision to create value for all stakeholders.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Market) Tj T* () Tj T* (The footwear market is very huge. Everybody wears shoes and many people buy shoes online. The) Tj T* (online shoe market is growing every year and will keep growing in the future. If we get even a) Tj T* (small percent of this big market, we will be very successful. Our target customers is small) Tj T* (footwear brands, of which there are a lot, thousands, and they all have the returns problem.) Tj T* (Also in the future we can sell to big brands and to retailers and also to customers directly.) Tj T* (We think the total market is billions of dollars. We have not done a detailed market sizing yet) Tj T* (but we believe it is big because shoes are a big industry and returns is a big problem in it.) Tj T* (The market is also underserved because small brands have no good option for sizing.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Business Model) Tj T* () Tj T* (Our business model has several revenue streams. First, brands will pay a subscription to use) Tj T* (Bootprint on their website. Second, we will sell the Bootprint mat, to the brands or to the) Tj T* (customers, and make money on the mat. Third, we might charge a fee per scan, or a percentage of) Tj T* (the returns that are saved, we have not decided yet which is best. Fourth, we can sell the data) Tj T* (we collect about feet to the brands and other companies who want to know about foot sizes,) Tj T* (which is very valuable data. Prices are to be determined but we think brands will pay a lot) Tj T* (because they will save money on returns. We believe the unit economics will be strong once we) Tj T* (scale. Customer acquisition will be done through social media and also by contacting brands) Tj T* (directly and by word of mouth, which is the best marketing.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Competition) Tj T* () Tj T* (There are not many competitors who do exactly what we do. Some big companies have sizing tools) Tj T* (but they are not for small brands and they are expensive and complicated. Also some brands just) Tj T* (have a size chart on their website, which is not accurate. Some other apps may do foot scanning) Tj T* (but they do not have our data driven engine and do not have the mat. We think our competitive) Tj T* (advantage is that we combine the scan, the mat, and the data engine together, which no one else) Tj T* (does, so we have a unique and defensible position. Also we are focused on small brands, which) Tj T* (are ignored by others. We are not worried about competition because we are first movers in our) Tj T* (specific niche, although we know that bigger companies could copy us if they wanted to.) Tj ET
endstream
