BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td () Tj T* (Team) Tj T* () Tj T* (Dmitri Kowalczyk is our CEO and he leads the vision and strategy of the company and also does) Tj T* (the business development. He is studying business at our university and he has always been) Tj T* (passionate about shoes and entrepreneurship. Brianna Oyelaran-Pike is our CTO and is in charge) Tj T* (of the technology, the scan, and the recommendation engine. She is a computer science student) Tj T* (and she is very skilled in coding and AI. Tobias Hargrove is our head of operations and design,) Tj T* (he works on the mat and the product and also on the customers. He studies design at our) Tj T* (university. Together we are a passionate and driven team with complementary skills who) Tj T* (experienced the problem of buying shoes online ourselves, so we are the right team to solve it.) Tj T* (We do not have advisors yet but we are looking for them.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Milestones and Financials) Tj T* () Tj T* (We have made good progress for a student team. We defined our core business concept, which took) Tj T* (a long time and many discussions. We formed Bootprint as a C Corp, so we are a real legal) Tj T* (company now. We also have our first external users on the product, who are people that tried) Tj T* (the scan, and they said it was interesting. We do not have a website yet but we are going to) Tj T* (make one. We have not got any revenue yet and we have not signed any brands as customers yet,) Tj T* (but we are in talks with some and think they will be interested. On financials, we have spent) Tj T* (only a little money so far, mostly on printing a few mats and some costs for the company) Tj T* (formation. We expect to have strong growth in revenue in the next years, going from zero to a) Tj T* (very large number, as we sign more brands and scale. We have not made detailed financial) Tj T* (projections but we are confident that Bootprint will be very profitable because the market is) Tj T* (big and our solution is innovative.) Tj T* () Tj T* (What We Ask For) Tj T* () Tj T* (We are asking for prize money from the competition to help us to build Bootprint. The money) Tj T* (would be used to build the product more, make more mats, build the website, hire people, and do) Tj T* (marketing to get customers. We also would like to get mentorship from the judges and the) Tj T* (experts, and connections to investors and to footwear brands, which would help us very much.) Tj T* (Also any resources like cloud credits or legal help would be useful for us. We believe that) Tj T* (with the support of this competition Bootprint can become the standard for shoe sizing online) Tj T* (and make a big impact on the footwear industry and on reducing waste from returns. Thank you) Tj T* (for considering our application and we hope to join the competition.) Tj ET
endstream
